# Generated harness reports (design-v3.1 §11). The P5 bake-off populates this.
# Keep the directory; ignore the generated JSON / sampler dumps.
*.json
*.sampler.txt
*.log
# Sustained-run scratch: per-run logs, per-second rate samples, and interim
# snapshot files. The reconciled .md/.csv/.svg deliverables are tracked.
*.runlog
*.samples
.sustained_*snap*
!.gitignore
